dinah-unsupported|a terminal whose setaf uses an operation the evaluator does not know,
	colors#8,
	clear=\E[H\E[2J, cup=\E[%i%p1%d;%p2%dH, ed=\E[J, el=\E[K,
	setaf=\E[3%p1%Qm, sgr0=\E[m,
dinah-no-cup|a terminal description with no cursor addressing,
	colors#8,
	clear=\E[H\E[2J, ed=\E[J, el=\E[K,
	setaf=\E[3%p1%dm, sgr0=\E[m,
dinah-xon|a terminal with xon whose strings carry delays,
	xon,
	colors#8,
	clear=\E[H\E[2J$<50>, cup=\E[%i%p1%d;%p2%dH$<5>, ed=\E[J$<50>, el=\E[K$<3>,
	setaf=\E[3%p1%dm, sgr0=\E[m,
dinah-delay|a terminal without xon whose cursor addressing carries a delay,
	colors#8,
	clear=\E[H\E[2J, cup=\E[%i%p1%d;%p2%dH$<5>, ed=\E[J, el=\E[K,
	setaf=\E[3%p1%dm, sgr0=\E[m,
